OL,3,GNEWSACentre marks 30 years of helping
OL,4,Acity's addicts
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpened in 1996, Ben's Centre was set up
OL,7,Fto provide support to people struggling
OL,8,Fwith drug or alcohol addiction and
OL,9,Frough sleeping. Now, 30 years on the
OL,10,FSheffield charity is marking three
OL,11,Fdecades of work.
OL,13,F"We're like a big happy family," says
OL,14,FEmma.
OL,16,F"They've seen me cry, they've seen my
OL,17,Fmental health. They give me cuddles or
OL,18,Fsit down and chat with me, they don't
OL,19,Fjudge you or talk to you as though
OL,20,Fyou're down on the floor."
